      "en": "nor of the pestilence that walks in darkness, nor of the destruction that wastes at noonday.",
      "ko": "흑암 중에 행하는 염병과 백주에 황폐케 하는 파멸을 두려워 아니하리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "c246b1965c8ce54f3eff8e8e84285dc065db52710b7336f78b2ddf208ecdc920",
      "translation_text_hash": "9d5ec3bffefa56055f166f16f8448fbae2691ce8b005b34cb38601a728b5e67e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
